  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class="sqsrte-large" style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">The modern meeting rooms at <strong>bee@work ANKER</strong> provide the ideal venue for business meetings, client presentations, workshops, interviews, board meetings, and corporate events in the heart of Budapest.</p><p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Whether you need a meeting room for just one hour or an entire working day, we offer flexible rental options for small teams and larger groups. Choose the room that best suits your meeting and enjoy a professional environment equipped for productive collaboration.</p><h3 style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Meeting Room Rental Prices (Gross)</h3><h4 style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">BEE Meeting Room (up to 4 people)</h4><p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">1 hour   <strong>HUF 5,000</strong></p><p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">1 working day   <strong>HUF 30,000</strong></p><h4 style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">BLUE Meeting Room (up to 12 people)</h4><p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">1 hour  <strong>HUF 9,000</strong></p><p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">1 working day   <strong>HUF 50,000</strong></p><h4 style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Conference Room (up to 50 people, Lower Ground Floor)</h4><p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">1 hour   <strong>HUF 12,000</strong></p><p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">1 working day   <strong>HUF 72,000</strong></p><p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Book the meeting room that best fits your needs and host your next business meeting, presentation, or event in a professional setting in downtown Budapest.</p></div>


  
